# Operator notes

Fill this in before you hand the brief to your agent. Delete the prompts you do not need.

- Machine: Apple M4 Pro, 48 GB
- Jobs this model must do: meeting transcript summaries, one operations task at a time
- Jobs that can be small and fast: email check, daily rollup
- What must not fail: names, dates, decisions, and amounts in a transcript
- What you will not pay for: a second API just to pick a local model
- How you like work done: one task, a read-back, no extra seats woken
- Models you refuse to run at the same time: llama.cpp 35B and oMLX 35B
